{{Anthrocon}}
'''Anthrocon 2026''' was the 29th annual [[Anthrocon]] [[furry convention]]. It was held on July 2–5, 2026, at the [[W:David L. Lawrence Convention Center|David L. Lawrence Convention Center]] in [[W:Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania|Pittsburgh]], [[W:Pennsylvania|Pennsylvania]], USA.

The convention's theme was '''''Cryptid Creatures & Critters''''', while the [[charity]] partner was ''[https://jandjfarmsanimalsanctuary.org/| J & J Farms Animal Sanctuary]''.<ref>[https://web.archive.org/web/20260225043444/https://www.anthrocon.org/charity/ Charity] page on Anthrocon.org. Archived from [https://www.anthrocon.org/charity/ the original] on February 25, 2026. Retrieved July 4, 2026.</ref>

